{"id":"316e0961875fbc6fcec98f54a5cfc92bb983ea61","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236860","title":"结束重置活动以后，你们都充 codex pro 了吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"turing518","excerpt":"OpenAI - @turing518 - 之前蹬爽了，隔三差五重置。现在不怎么重置了，感觉 plus 完全不够用，一天就用了 60%的周额度，这周还有好多任务没开发，考虑要不要开 pro 。你们都开 pro 了吗，开了的话是 5x 还是 20","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>之前蹬爽了，隔三差五重置。现在不怎么重置了，感觉 plus 完全不够用，一天就用了 60%的周额度，这周还有好多任务没开发，考虑要不要开 pro 。你们都开 pro 了吗，开了的话是 5x 还是 20x 的？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/重置\"><li></li> 重置</a><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/Pro\"><li></li> Pro</a></P><p><span>21 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-25 09:32:13 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012036\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/762d/d577/19959_normal.png?m=1723165448\" alt=\"Alwaysonline\" data-uid=\"19959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Alwaysonline\">Alwaysonline</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 17:38:17 +08:00\">23h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>还是得开 20X ，矮个子里还是 Codex 舒服点，至少有个 X 沟通交流渠道。</p><p>不像某些 699 套餐，见 1 次黑 1 次， 贵+额度低。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012163\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b31d/7645/536249_normal.png?m=1711436800\" alt=\"jackerbauer\" data-uid=\"536249\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackerbauer\">jackerbauer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 17:58:47 +08:00\">23h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉国模已经很不错了，开个 PLUS 做做复杂任务，剩下全部交给国模做</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012393\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1d7d/8905/477613_normal.png?m=1586326604\" alt=\"XTTX\" data-uid=\"477613\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/XTTX\">XTTX</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 19:09:46 +08:00\">22h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 有第一梯队的 gpt img 2,  对独立开发真的很友好。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5773/29ee/217800_normal.png?m=1758522962\" alt=\"urlk\" data-uid=\"217800\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/urlk\">urlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 19:13:11 +08:00\">22h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用量很小, 之前送的三次重置卡都没用到 , 每次官方重置我都还剩 90%  100% 的用量, 几天不登一次 ... 但是用到的时候没有不行 就开着呗 隔段时间充点里拉 也不贵</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012641\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a1eb9cbe38956f3c76073e6c5de524db?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Eosdivus\" data-uid=\"840657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Eosdivus\">Eosdivus</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 20:54:29 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我最早土区开了个 Plus ，后面不够用，但是因为订阅价格是没有涨价之前的，舍不得升级。于是去美区开了个 Pro 5X 。上个月月底玻区好价，用正常 5X 的价格开了一个 20X 。这个月 5X 到期，停止续费了。现在就是土区 Plus+玻区 Pro 20X</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012717\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f16/c818/1085_normal.png?m=1760330213\" alt=\"iiduce\" data-uid=\"1085\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iiduce\">iiduce</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 21:37:05 +08:00\">19h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>今天早晨重置后，体感明显更耐用了。单会话 sol xhigh 跑了一上午，用掉 20x 周限制的 3%.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012812\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/864c52a89572b499af659d57302811b9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lzylzylzy130\" data-uid=\"335358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lzylzylzy130\">lzylzylzy130</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 22:25:05 +08:00\">18h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>把 20x 换 5x 了，codex 5x 负责写文档出主意，claude 还是 20x 负责写代码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012869\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a379fd7d63ee8779653d6b03badd076b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kneo\" data-uid=\"640670\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kneo\">kneo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 22:50:26 +08:00\">18h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/iiduce\">iiduce</a> &gt;今天早晨重置后，体感明显更耐用了。单会话 sol xhigh 跑了一上午，用掉 20x 周限制的 3%.</p><p>从我这边的 ccusage 用量来看，以美元为单位，codex 周限额差不多有之前的两倍，但还是不足 claude 的一半。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18012876\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e4b42ff48cb2a2c3e5e22ff67fb9abcd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dnfQzjPBXtWmML\" data-uid=\"619763\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dnfQzjPBXtWmML\">dnfQzjPBXtWmML</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 22:53:02 +08:00\">18h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>non. tibo 频繁重置是为了让我上瘾，我现在重置岂不是让 tibo 你得逞了🐶</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18013069\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/003f/2c1d/73238_normal.png?m=1504595317\" alt=\"thorlay\" data-uid=\"73238\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/thorlay\">thorlay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 01:34:34 +08:00\">15h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>怎么那么多人开 20x ，你们 20x 拿来纯用来干自己项目吗，能回本吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18013571\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a1eb9cbe38956f3c76073e6c5de524db?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Eosdivus\" data-uid=\"840657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Eosdivus\">Eosdivus</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 09:32:13 +08:00\">7h 42m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Mmnni\">Mmnni</a> 我还没有到续费时间，但是看很多人已经续费成功了，应该没什么问题。现在玻区新订阅和土区 Plus 一样都是涨价后的新价格。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"之前蹬爽了，隔三差五重置。现在不怎么重置了，感觉 plus 完全不够用，一天就用了 60%的周额度，这周还有好多任务没开发，考虑要不要开 pro 。你们都开 pro 了吗，开了的话是 5x 还是 20x 的？ 重置 Codex Pro21 replies • 2026-08-25 09:32:13 +08:00 2 Alwaysonline 23h 36m ago 还是得开 20X ，矮个子里还是 Codex 舒服点，至少有个 X 沟通交流渠道。不像某些 699 套餐，见 1 次黑 1 次， 贵+额度低。 5 jackerbauer 23h 16m ago 感觉国模已经很不错了，开个 PLUS 做做复杂任务，剩下全部交给国模做 6 XTTX 22h 5m ago codex 有第一梯队的 gpt img 2, 对独立开发真的很友好。 7 urlk 22h 1m ago 用量很小, 之前送的三次重置卡都没用到 , 每次官方重置我都还剩 90% 100% 的用量, 几天不登一次 ... 但是用到的时候没有不行 就开着呗 隔段时间充点里拉 也不贵 9 Eosdivus 20h 20m ago 我最早土区开了个 Plus ，后面不够用，但是因为订阅价格是没有涨价之前的，舍不得升级。于是去美区开了个 Pro 5X 。上个月月底玻区好价，用正常 5X 的价格开了一个 20X 。这个月 5X 到期，停止续费了。现在就是土区 Plus+玻区 Pro 20X 10 iiduce 19h 38m ago 今天早晨重置后，体感明显更耐用了。单会话 sol xhigh 跑了一上午，用掉 20x 周限制的 3%. 11 lzylzylzy130 18h 50m ago 把 20x 换 5x 了，